<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;color:#141519;">Verify your email address</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Hi {{ name }},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">Welcome to {{ brand }}. Please confirm that this is your email address so we can keep your account safe and reach you when it matters.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px 0;">
<tr>
<td style="background-color:#c3e84f;border-radius:8px;">
<a href="{{ link }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;color:#141519;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;">Verify my email address</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;color:#4b4e4a;font-size:14px;">If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
<a href="{{ link }}" style="color:#141519;word-break:break-all;">{{ link }}</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">This link works once and expires on {{ expires_at }}. If it has expired, sign in and ask for a new one.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">If you did not create a {{ brand }} account, you can ignore this email.</p>
